\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Day by day we magnify Thee,
\par When, as each new day is born,
\par On our knees at home, we bless Thee
\par For the mercies of the morn.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Day by day we magnify Thee,
\par When our hymns in school we raise,
\par Daily work begun and ended
\par With the daily voice of praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Day by day we magnify Thee
\par In our hymns before we sleep;
\par Angels hear them, watching by us,
\par Christ's dear lambs all night to keep.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Day by day we magnify Thee
\par Not in words of praise alone;
\par Truthful lips and meek obedience
\par Show Thy glory in Thine own.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Day by day we magnify Thee,
\par When for Jesu's sake we try
\par Every wrong to bear with patience,
\par Every sin to mortify.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Day by day we magnify Thee,
\par Till our days on earth shall cease,
\par Till we rest from these our labours,
\par Waiting for Thy day in peace.
\par  \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

